@best-practices.fail-fast

Purpose:
  Detect errors as early as possible.

UseWhen:
  - input validation
  - configuration errors
  - dependency checks
  - precondition verification

Why:
  Early failure reduces debugging time and prevents cascading errors.

Related:
  @best-practices.clean-code
  @engineering.fail-fast

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
